  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "After gaining Shadow Sect’s inheritance, Fang Yuan learns that You Chan has one of the ten extreme physiques, the Myriad Gold Wondrous Essence Physique. It is her greatest secret. Shadow Sect had a specialized method to search for the ten extreme physiques while gathering them to refine sovereign immortal fetus Gu, and found her during that search, but already held a Myriad Gold Wondrous Essence Physique and did not target her. You Chan cultivates water path despite the physique because she obtained a water path inheritance as a lone cultivator and then judged changing paths too risky.",
      "chapters": [
        1473
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "fac_shadow_sect",
        "char_fang_yuan",
        "char_you_chan",
        "gu_sovereign_immortal_fetus_gu"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "The Legends of Ren Zu, chapter four, section twenty-seven, records how Ren Zu refines a Gu everyone wants and, after throwing his own hands into the fire, a girl appears who names herself Myriad Gold Wondrous Essence and presents Wealth Gu.",
      "chapters": [
        1473
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "ren-zu-child",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "sys_the_legends_of_ren_zu",
        "char_ren_zu",
        "gu_wealth_gu"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "In a further telling of that legend, Ren Zu brings his son Blazing Glory Lightning Brilliance and daughter Myriad Gold Wondrous Essence to the feathermen’s residence. Fate Gu throws the two children far away, out of Ren Zu’s sight.",
      "chapters": [
        1619
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "legend-continuation",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_blazing_glory_lightning_brilliance",
        "gu_fate_gu"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Blazing Glory Lightning Brilliance and Myriad Gold Wondrous Essence are forced to leave Ren Zu and arrive at immemorial blue heaven. Lightning surrounds them, and Myriad Gold Wondrous Essence wishes they still had Wealth Gu before lightning Gu draws near.",
      "chapters": [
        2021
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "siblings-trapped-by-lightning-gu",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
